                "metadata": {
                    "category": "podcast",
                    "description": "Kids ask and scientists answer! 🚀🦋 Featuring scientists from leading museums, universities, zoos, and more!\nPerfect for families with children ages 3-10 🌟\n🧪 Submit your kids' questions for episodes! Visit: www.cumbrekids.org/questions\n\nEpisodes develop children's science vocabulary while inspiring a love for STEM topics and careers 🔬\n\nEpisodes available in English and Spanish! Spanish episodes on:\n🧬 Cráneo: Ciencia para niños curiosos\n🦎 Camaleón: Animales para niños curiosos\n\nOrbit is produced by Cumbre Kids: www.cumbrekids.org",
